 class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 3, 2000<br/>Version 6.0 Beta</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150211194605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Campfire_638097.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a campfire.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creature</a> camps like Amazon Camp and some <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Troll</a> caves.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Beware of walking over it! You'll get burnt (20 - 10 - 10 damage).<br/> There are also other variants:<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Campfire (Medium)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Campfire_Medium_8b48fa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> (lightradius: 5) <br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Campfire (Low)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Campfire_Low_e681fe.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> (lighradius: 3) <br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Unlit Campfire\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Unlit_Campfire_6b025f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> Unlit Campfire\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Burning</li><li>Burnt Down Firewood</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Campfire%20%28Pot%29\">Campfire (Pot)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Daily%20Respawns\">Daily Respawns</a></li><li>Flora and Minerals</li><li>Illumination</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Noodles%20Academy%20of%20Modern%20Magic\">Noodles Academy of Modern Magic</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Raw%20Meat\">Raw Meat</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Roasted%20Meat\">Roasted Meat</a></li><li>Rocks</li><li>Stockfish</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Circle\">Stone Circle</a></li><li>Trolls</li><li>Unlit Campfire</li><li>Utilities</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["krailos-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"krailos-quest","quest":"Krailos Quest","step":"3-1","n":37,"title":"Juntar a comida","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33684,"y":31723,"z":7,"label":"Barril com a Ogre Beer"}]}]}}